        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Pittsburgh Penguins, New York Islanders\n- Seasons: 1981–82 Pittsburgh Penguins season, 1981–82 New York Islanders season\n- Competitions: National Hockey League, Stanley Cup playoffs, Stanley Cup\n\nFacts:\n- The 1981–82 Pittsburgh Penguins season was the Pittsburgh Penguins' 15th season in the National Hockey League.\n- In the 1981–82 season, the Pittsburgh Penguins qualified for the playoffs for the fourth straight year.\n- In the 1981–82 Stanley Cup playoffs, the New York Islanders defeated the Pittsburgh Penguins in the opening round three games to two.\n- The New York Islanders later became the eventual Stanley Cup champion in 1981–82.\n- The 1981–82 New York Islanders season was the franchise's 10th season.\n- The 1981–82 New York Islanders season ended with the team winning the Stanley Cup.",
